        {
          "if": "bound(attacker)",
          "body": "{court.name} keeps the day you broke {attacker.name}'s siege at {a.place} as a holiday. {ruler.name} has had your likeness carved over the gate, too thin and with too many teeth. {attacker.name} keeps the day too, differently."
