      "body": "{heir.name} of {court.name} has read the oath {heir.pronoun} inherited: tribute to the mountain, sworn {a.years_ago} years ago by a terrified ancestor. The book also records why. {heir.name} is not terrified. The tribute has arrived this year, exactly, with a note asking whether the mountain is still there.",
