      "body": "You judged {spared.name} and let {spared.pronoun} live, in front of the whole square, {a.years_ago} years ago. {spared.name} rules {court.name} now and has never once mentioned it in public. In private, every envoy who leaves for the mountain is briefed by {spared.name} personally.",
